00:33:24,048 --> 00:33:28,048
Give me more, I need more, oh you'll be begging on the floor

547
00:33:28,048 --> 00:33:33,048
自分次第 衝撃与え 動くよショータイム
It's up to you, delivering an impact, it's showtime

548
00:33:33,048 --> 00:33:39,048
[魂を捧げ、そして平伏せ] Give me some more
[Offer up thy soul and kneel.] Give me some more

549
00:33:39,048 --> 00:33:47,048
[彼女の意志に跪く者たちよ...] Just a little bit more
[For those who bow before her will...] Just a little bit more

550
00:33:47,048 --> 00:33:51,048
[彼女の軌跡を目撃せよ]
[WITNESS HER LEGACY!]

551
00:33:54,048 --> 00:33:58,248
I finally did it!

552
00:33:58,248 --> 00:34:03,548
I can't believe it guys, I did it!

553
00:34:03,548 --> 00:34:09,548
I am finally holding my very own solo concert!

554
00:34:09,548 --> 00:34:15,548
ソロライブ決定です！やったー！
My solo concert is officially decided! Yay!

555
00:34:15,548 --> 00:34:20,248
I'm so happy!

556
00:34:20,248 --> 00:34:24,248
本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you so much!

557
00:34:24,248 --> 00:34:28,848
It's gonna be happening on December 1st of this year,

558
00:34:28,848 --> 00:34:33,448
and the venue is none other than Kanadevia Hall in Tokyo!

559
00:34:33,448 --> 00:34:39,148
えっと、なんと12月1日決定されました、ソロライブです！
And, my solo concert is confirmed for December 1st!

560
00:34:39,148 --> 00:34:44,248
えっと、東京のKanadevia Hallで開催決定です！
It's officially being held at Kanadevia Hall in Tokyo!

561
00:34:44,248 --> 00:34:49,048
もう決定、決定ですよ、みんな！やったー！
It's decided, it's decided everyone! Yay!

562
00:34:49,048 --> 00:34:52,048
えっと、ライブのタイトルは『REGALIA』。
And, the title of the concert is "REGALIA".

563
00:34:52,048 --> 00:34:55,248
This is the title of the live, REGALIA.

564
00:34:55,248 --> 00:35:00,048
I chose this title because I wanted this live to, you know, become...

565
00:35:00,056 --> 00:35:08,156
...symbol of my journey so far, and hopefully, a symbol for what is yet to come for Hakos Baelz, you know.

566
00:35:08,156 --> 00:35:11,756
えっと、ま、今回のライブタイトルは「REGALIA」です。
Um, well, the title of this live concert is "REGALIA".

567
00:35:11,756 --> 00:35:18,056
このライブは、ね、僕のこれまでの活動を象徴するぞっていう意思を込めて、このタイトルにしました。
I chose this title with the intention of making this live concert a symbol of my activities so far.

568
00:35:18,056 --> 00:35:25,056
えっと、チケットやグッズの情報は後日発表しますので、もう少々お待ちください。
Um, information about tickets and merchandise will be announced at a later date, so please wait a little longer.

569
00:35:25,056 --> 00:35:29,856
Tickets and goods will be announced later on, so please get hyped!

570
00:35:29,856 --> 00:35:32,456
I did it! I did it!

571
00:35:33,056 --> 00:35:34,656
And there's more!

572
00:35:34,656 --> 00:35:43,156
In celebration of my first ever solo live, I am so happy to announce that my second album, "Mirror Mirror", is on its way!

573
00:35:43,156 --> 00:35:49,056
Pre-orders will open today from 9:00 PM JST on the Hololive Production Official Shop.

574
00:35:49,056 --> 00:35:55,756
そして、えっと、ま、ライブに向けてセカンドアルバムも、あの、出ます！
And, um, well, in preparation for the live concert, my second album is also, you know, coming out!

575
00:35:55,756 --> 00:35:59,056
「Mirror Mirror」というリリースが、あの、決定しました！
The release of "Mirror Mirror" has been decided!

576
00:35:59,056 --> 00:36:09,556
えっと、日本時間で今日23日の夜9時から、えっと、ホロライブプロダクション公式ショップで、あの、ま、受注開始されます！
Um, pre-orders will open on the Hololive Production Official Shop starting tonight at 9:00 PM JST on the 23rd!

577
00:36:09,556 --> 00:36:13,056
ありがとうございます。本当にありがとうございます。
Thank you. Thank you so much.

578
00:36:13,056 --> 00:36:17,356
This album is so special to me. It...

579
00:36:17,356 --> 00:36:23,056
includes many songs. Um, actually, I wrote the lyrics of most of the songs on this album,

580
00:36:23,056 --> 00:36:32,056
with the theme of reflection, facing oneself, and this album was a project where I pushed myself to explore even more ways to express myself as an artist.

581
00:36:32,056 --> 00:36:40,056
えっとなんとですね、今回のアルバムの曲はだいたい全部、歌詞の方は自分で書いてました。
And actually, I wrote the lyrics for almost all the songs on this album myself.

582
00:36:40,056 --> 00:36:51,556
えっと、ま、「リフレクション、自己との向き合い」っていうテーマの下で、ま、アーティストとしてのさらなる表現力を、えっと、追求した作品となってます。
With the theme of reflection and facing oneself, this is a work where I wanted to pursue further expressiveness as an artist.

583
00:36:51,556 --> 00:36:56,056
Uh, it also comes with a lot of, uh, album bonuses.
Uh, it also comes with a lot of album bonuses.

584
00:36:56,056 --> 00:37:05,856
You'll receive a special message letter with my signature, an original mirror sticker, and an artbook-style lyric booklet. I'll be signing every single one of them, so please get it!

585
00:37:05,856 --> 00:37:12,556
あとね、アルバム、え、購入特典もあります。サイン入りのスペシャルメッセージ、日本語版も、英語版もあります。
Also, there are album purchase bonuses. There's a signed special message, available in both Japanese and English versions.

586
00:37:12,556 --> 00:37:17,556
オリジナルミラーステッカーもあります。アートブック型の歌詞カードもあります。
An original mirror sticker is also included. There is also an artbook-style lyric card.

587
00:37:17,556 --> 00:37:24,556
え、もう買ってくれ、て、くれたみんなも、サイン、サインをしますので、ぜひぜひよろしくお願いします。
Um, for everyone who purchases it, I will be signing them, so please check it out.

588
00:37:24,556 --> 00:37:29,556
Ah, you can check the shop directly from YouTube, um, and both the album shipment and the digital release...

589
00:37:29,556 --> 00:37:35,556
...are scheduled for November 2nd JST. So get hyped!

590
00:37:35,556 --> 00:37:39,556
Stay tuned, there's a lot yet to come.

591
00:37:39,556 --> 00:37:44,556
えっと、ショ、あ、YouTubeからショップ、え、アクセスできるので、ぜひチェックしてください。
Um, you can access the shop directly from YouTube, so please check it out.

592
00:37:44,556 --> 00:37:53,056
また発送と、え、デジタルリリースは11月2日を予定しております。楽しみにしててください。
Also, shipment and the digital release are scheduled for November 2nd. Please look forward to it!

593
00:37:53,056 --> 00:37:56,056
そして！そして！そして！
And! And! And!

594
00:37:56,056 --> 00:38:03,556
Ah, I may have mentioned before that there is a new song releasing today, and that is right!

595
00:38:03,556 --> 00:38:13,556
Right after this stream, the music video for "I found me", which is a very, very special song that is actually the first song I ever wrote from scratch, will be releasing, will be premiering after this stream.

596
00:38:13,556 --> 00:38:20,556
えっと、この配信が終わったとき、ちょっと、あの、アルバムからの一曲「I found me」のMVが公開します。
Um, when this stream ends, the MV for "I found me", a song from the album, will be released.

597
00:38:20,556 --> 00:38:32,556
この曲は、僕にとってめっちゃ大事な曲なんで、そして、初めて一から書いた曲なんで、あの、歌詞の方にね。なのでぜひぜひ、プレミア、公開、よろしくお願いします。
This song is very important to me, and it's the first time I've written lyrics from scratch. So please check out the premiere!

598
00:38:32,556 --> 00:38:37,356
The MV will be the opening video for my segment during YouTube Music Weekend!

599
00:38:37,356 --> 00:38:40,056
Ta-da!

600
00:38:40,056 --> 00:38:51,556
It's a lot! I'm so happy! My fifth anniversary and I get to be a part of YouTube Music Weekend. Um, so it will be the opening video for my section, which starts at 1:15 PM JST. So make sure you check it out!

601
00:38:51,556 --> 00:39:03,056
このMVは、このあと13時15分からスタートする「YouTube Music Weekend」で、僕のオープニングパートにもなってるので、ぜひぜひ、これも、チェックしてください！
This MV is also the opening part for my segment in the YouTube Music Weekend starting at 1:15 PM JST, so please check it out as well!

602
00:39:03,056 --> 00:39:06,056
Ah! I did it!

603
00:39:06,056 --> 00:39:09,556
Ah, that was a lot of announcements.

604
00:39:09,556 --> 00:39:20,556
Are you guys, are you guys proud of me? I hope so. You guys know why I've been so busy now! I've been busy. I've been...

605
00:39:20,556 --> 00:39:30,556
already doing a lot of prep for this amazing event that's happening, and I'll be sharing more details about the concert at a later date, so I really hope you look forward to it.

606
00:39:30,556 --> 00:39:41,556
えっと、ま、最近ちょっと僕ね、あの、疲れてるプラスめっちゃ忙しくなった理由もこれになりますので、本当に頑張りますので、あの、楽しみにしててください！
Um, well, this is also the reason why I've been a bit tired and extremely busy lately, so I'll do my absolute best! Please look forward to it!

607
00:39:41,556 --> 00:39:45,056
All right, with that being said, I think it's time to move on to the next segment.

608
00:39:45,056 --> 00:39:49,056
ちょっと次のコーナーに、行きたいと思います！
I'd like to move on to the next segment!

609
00:39:58,556 --> 00:40:00,056
Welcome to...

610
00:40:00,104 --> 00:40:05,254
ベージマイトコンコクション！イェーイ！
Bae-gemite Concoctions! Yay!

611
00:40:13,104 --> 00:40:16,904
見てる方も I think everyone knows... 一応、自己紹介お願いしていいですか？
For everyone watching... I think everyone knows, but could you please introduce yourselves?

612
00:40:16,904 --> 00:40:18,604
はい！もちろんございます。じゃ、私から。
Yes! Of course. I'll go first then.

613
00:40:18,604 --> 00:40:24,104
ホロスターズの夕刻ロベルです。本日はよろしくお願いいたします。
I'm Yukoku Roberu from Holostars. Thank you for having me today!

614
00:40:24,104 --> 00:40:27,804
なんか不穏な感じがね、しますけど。
そうですね。
It feels a bit ominous, though.
Yes, it does.

615
00:40:27,804 --> 00:40:30,104
はい、怖いです。
Yes, I'm scared.

616
00:40:30,104 --> 00:40:34,604
怖くない、怖くないもんね。そうね。
頑張りたいと思います。よろしくお願いします。
No, I'm not. I'm not scared, right?
I'll do my best. Thank you very much.

617
00:40:34,604 --> 00:40:36,604
よろしくお願いします。そして？
はい。
Thank you! And next?
Yes.

618
00:40:36,604 --> 00:40:40,104
あの、理由も分からず呼び出されて
Um, I was called here without being told why...

619
00:40:40,104 --> 00:40:48,104
仕事だと思って来たら、なんだか不穏なスタジオでした。石川界人です。声優です。よろしくお願いします。
And when I thought it was just a regular job, I ended up in this ominous studio. I'm Ishikawa Kaito, a voice actor. Pleased to meet you.

620
00:40:48,104 --> 00:40:52,604
そんな我々からも、ちょっとベエちゃんに言わなきゃいけないこと、あります。
ありますね。
Actually, we have something we need to tell you too, Bae-chan.
We do.

621
00:40:52,604 --> 00:40:54,604
はい、じゃあ行きましょう。
はい。
All right, let's go.
Yes.

622
00:40:54,604 --> 00:40:55,304
せーの！
One, two...

623
00:40:55,304 --> 00:41:00,104
ソロライブ開催決定、おめでとう！
ありがとうございます！
Congratulations on your solo live concert!
Thank you so much!

624
00:41:00,104 --> 00:41:03,104
すごいことよ！
あ、泣いちゃった。あららら。
That's a huge deal!
Ah, she's crying. Oh dear.

625
00:41:05,104 --> 00:41:08,104
嬉しい。
嬉しい？いや、すごいことよ。おめでとう。
I'm so happy.
Are you happy? It's really amazing. Congratulations.

626
00:41:08,104 --> 00:41:11,604
ありがとうございます。
本当におめでとう。
Thank you very much.
My sincere congratulations.

627
00:41:11,604 --> 00:41:14,304
なんか、一VTuberファンとしてさ、
You know, as a fellow VTuber fan...

628
00:41:14,304 --> 00:41:17,104
ソロライブというのは夢じゃん。
夢ですよね。本当に。
A solo live is like the ultimate dream.
It really is a dream. Truly.

629
00:41:19,304 --> 00:41:21,604
なんかもう、熱いわ！
ありがとうございます。
I'm getting emotional!
Thank you so much.

630
00:41:24,104 --> 00:41:26,604
本当に、素晴らしい本当に。
Truly, it's wonderful. Really.

631
00:41:26,604 --> 00:41:31,104
えーと、今日はね、チャレンジをやりたいと思います。
チャレンジ。チャレンジ。
Well, today, we're going to do a challenge.
A challenge? Yes, a challenge.

632
00:41:31,104 --> 00:41:42,604
Challenge. Today, we've invited these two for a challenge called "The Bae-gemite Concoctions." We've come up with some absolutely outrageous Vegemite concoctions.
Today, we've invited these two for a challenge called "The Bae-gemite Concoctions." We've come up with some absolutely outrageous Vegemite concoctions.

633
00:41:42,604 --> 00:41:48,104
まあ、ロベさん、界人さんはもうベージマイトのことご存知しておりますよね？もちろん。
Well, Robe-san and Kaito-san, you're already familiar with Vegemite, right? Of course.

634
00:41:48,104 --> 00:41:51,304
なんか当たり前のように口にしてるけど、
You say it like it's a completely normal thing, but...

635
00:41:51,304 --> 00:41:54,604
我々にとっては、その、呪詛みたいなもん。
For us, it's basically like a curse.

636
00:41:54,604 --> 00:41:58,304
そう、あの、怖いのよ。結構。
Yeah, it's actually pretty terrifying.

637
00:41:58,304 --> 00:42:03,104
ベージマイトで言ったら、まあ、ロベさんですよね？
そうなの？
Speaking of Vegemite, that's your thing, right, Robe-san?
Is it?

638
00:42:03,104 --> 00:42:08,104
いや、でもね、正直、ベージマイトという道を作ってしまった張本人かもしれん。
そうです。
But honestly, I might be the one who paved this Vegemite path.
Yes, indeed.

639
00:42:08,104 --> 00:42:12,604
ベエちゃんにベージマイトっていうものがあるよって教えてもらって、僕がその実食配信みたいのをするようになったんですよ。
Bae-chan told me about Vegemite, and I ended up doing a tasting stream.

640
00:42:12,604 --> 00:42:16,104
そこから始まったこの地獄は。
そして被害者たちが。
That where this hell began, probably.
And then, the victims...

641
00:42:16,104 --> 00:42:22,104
被害者たちが生まれていった。
The victims started piling up.

642
00:42:22,104 --> 00:42:27,304
そうで、一緒にね、その配信で、食レポみたいな配信したこともあって。
うんうん。
And we once did a tasting review stream together.
Right, right.

643
00:42:27,304 --> 00:42:34,604
で、それ以来なんで、このこいつと対峙するのは、3, 4年ぶりぐらいになります、私は。
So since then, facing off against this thing... It's been about 3 or 4 years for me.

644
00:42:34,604 --> 00:42:36,604
あ、じゃあもう、味も忘れちゃってそうだもんね。
So you've probably forgotten what it tastes like.

645
00:42:36,604 --> 00:42:39,104
ううん、あのね、こびり付いてる。
No, it's burned into my memory.

646
00:42:39,104 --> 00:42:44,304
4年経っても消えない。
言い方。
味の記憶がこびり付いてる。
Even after 4 years, it won't go away.
What a way to put it.
The memory of the taste is stuck there.

647
00:42:44,304 --> 00:42:49,104
うん、だから非常にね、怖さはあるけど、まあでもね、楽しみですよ。
So, yes, I'm very scared, but I'm looking forward to it too.

648
00:42:49,104 --> 00:42:51,104
もっと元気そうに。
Say it with more energy!

649
00:42:51,104 --> 00:42:54,604
楽しみです！イェーイ！すごい楽しみ、食べたい！
I'm looking forward to it! Yay! I can't wait to eat it!

650
00:42:55,104 --> 00:42:58,904
そして、界人さん。ベージマイトエピソードってことあります？
And Kaito-san, do you have any Vegemite episodes?

651
00:42:58,904 --> 00:43:04,604
ああ、ベージマイトエピソードですか？非常に素晴らしいあの、食材ですよね。
Ah, my Vegemite episode? It's a truly wonderful ingredient, isn't it?

652
00:43:04,604 --> 00:43:11,904
もらってましたよね？ベエちゃんから。ホロごえで一緒になった時に、ベエちゃんからありがたいお土産をもらってましたよね。
You got some from Bae-chan, right? When you were on Hologoe together, you received a wonderful souvenir from Bae-chan, right?

653
00:43:11,904 --> 00:43:17,104
ええ。番組収録終了時にね、わざわざ楽屋にご挨拶いただいて、
Yes, after we finished recording, she came to my dressing room to greet me...

654
00:43:17,104 --> 00:43:22,104
素敵なかただなというふうに思って受け取って、「これお土産です」と。
And I thought, "What a polite and wonderful person." So I accepted it and she said, "This is a souvenir."

655
00:43:22,104 --> 00:43:25,604
ありがとうございます。あれですか？なんかお菓子か何かですか？あ、ベージマイトです。
I said, "Thank you. Is it some kind of snack?" And she said, "No, it's Vegemite."

656
00:43:25,604 --> 00:43:33,904
一応、食べましたよ。
I did eat it, for the record.

657
00:43:33,904 --> 00:43:38,304
おお、偉い！
食べました？
ちゃんと食べました。
Wow, how admirable!
Really?
Yes, I ate it properly.

658
00:43:38,304 --> 00:43:42,604
絶対食べてないと思ったもん。
なんて素晴らしい食材なんだろうって。
I was sure you didn't eat it.
I thought, "What a wonderful ingredient."

659
00:43:42,604 --> 00:43:47,104
ありがとうございます！
素晴らしいんだ、やっぱベージマイトというのは。
Thank you so much!
So Vegemite really is amazing after all.

660
00:43:48,104 --> 00:43:54,604
ちょっとね、記憶もね、あんまないと思いますので、ちょっと、先に、生で、食べさせてもらいます。
Since you might not remember it well, I'm going to have you taste it raw first.

661
00:43:54,604 --> 00:43:58,604
I got to refresh their memories on the taste, so we do have Vegemite prepared in front of us.

662
00:43:58,604 --> 00:44:00,604
大丈夫。大丈夫。
I'll be fine. I'll be fine.

663
00:44:00,604 --> 00:44:04,604
いや、大丈夫じゃないです。
あの、大丈夫だよ。
No, you won't be fine.
It's okay.

664
00:44:04,604 --> 00:44:09,604
あの、お願いして、わけじゃなくて、5周年なんで、命令です。食えと。
It's not like I'm asking you nicely. It's my 5th anniversary, so it's an order. Eat it.

665
00:44:09,604 --> 00:44:12,904
ソロライブも決まってるしな。
Well, her solo live is confirmed, after all.

666
00:44:12,904 --> 00:44:16,904
めでたい人の命令じゃ。
そうです。
It's an order from the star of the hour.
Yes, indeed.

667
00:44:17,604 --> 00:44:21,104
あ、怖い！
はい、じゃ、せーの！
Ah, I'm scared!
Okay, one, two...

668
00:44:21,104 --> 00:44:25,104
乾杯！
Cheers!

669
00:44:25,104 --> 00:44:29,604
あ、美味しい。
美味しい！
Ah, delicious.
It's tasty!

670
00:44:36,104 --> 00:44:40,104
うまい。すごい。
Tasty! This is intense.

671
00:44:40,104 --> 00:44:44,304
大丈夫ですか？
Are you okay?

672
00:44:44,304 --> 00:44:48,104
大丈夫な、えっ！もう飲み切っちゃいました！
Wait! He already finished the whole bottle of water!

673
00:44:48,104 --> 00:44:53,104
はい、えー、Ishikawa Kaito has finished one bottle of water. 早いですね。
Yes, Ishikawa Kaito has finished one bottle of water. That was fast.

674
00:44:53,104 --> 00:44:59,104
お水にとても合うな！
This goes so well with water!

675
00:45:00,119 --> 00:45:01,919
あー、幸せ。
Ah, so happy...

676
00:45:03,319 --> 00:45:07,619
大丈夫でしょうか？ちょっと、あの...しんじ先輩の顔がえぐい。
Are you alright? Shinji-senpai's face looks intense...

677
00:45:07,619 --> 00:45:09,119
おおー。
Oh...

678
00:45:09,119 --> 00:45:10,119
泣いてる。
He's crying.

679
00:45:10,119 --> 00:45:12,119
泣いてます？
Are you crying?

