なんとね、あの、 this time, the 5th anniversary merch doesn't involve as many items, just because I know there's a lot happening. We've got the album, and also the live concert and everything.
And this time, the 5th anniversary merch doesn't have as many items, just because I know there's a lot happening. We've got the album, and also the live concert and everything.

