アイドル！
As an idol!

1082
01:10:25,694 --> 01:10:28,694
バカにする奴は嫌いだ
I hate those who make fun of us,

1083
01:10:28,694 --> 01:10:31,594
見下されるのも嫌いだ
and I hate being looked down upon.

1084
